u(1,8,12,'Card readable identity, four values and type',[21,23,29],'species record → card values → render/flip/price','Card exposes stored identity and supplied form separately.','Four directional values and selected type are read by the real duel, pricing and artwork consumers.')
u(2,13,30,'Card construction',[21,23,29],'Species.get_species_form → base values/type → card', 'Shape lookup uses the supplied identity and form; legal default consumers supply form zero.','West and north add integer speed/3; east and south add integer HP/3 to their respective attacking/defensive base values.','The first type is selected except NORMAL with an available second type selects the second.','No individual level, IV, EV, nature or party stat is consumed.','Unknown shape lookup leaves no record and fails when its base stats are read; it is not silently substituted with a valid species.')
u(3,32,43,'Ten base-value bands',[25,27],'four raw card quantities → card numbers','Descending thresholds are 189,160,134,115,100,86,73,60,45; outputs are respectively10 through2, otherwise1.','Each boundary is inclusive at the lower edge; values between adjacent thresholds use the lower band.')
u(4,45,51,'Attack and opposing defense direction',[23,88],'neighbor index left/right/up/down → compared card sides','Attack directions in neighbor order are west/east/north/south.','Defense directions in that same order are east/west/south/north; each is the facing side of the neighbor.')
u(5,53,63,'Inactive elemental effectiveness helper',[29],'Type effectiveness → callable helper; actual flip does not call it','When directly called, immunity yields−2, resistance−1, super-effectiveness+1 and neutral0.','The actual comparison has no active call to this helper; this capability does not add ordinary type effectiveness to the current duel. Exact unused helper offsets are recorded here as inactive source facts, not a new mandatory duel rule.')
u(6,65,85,'Price and quantization',[31],'card values → purchase price → sell price','M is the largest side, Q the four-side sum and Z the square sum; raw price is floor((Z+2M²)×M×Q/10).','Select step1000 above10000,500 above5000,100 above1000,50 above500, otherwise10.','Always move to the strictly next step multiple, including exact multiples.','Four10s yield raw24000 and purchase25000; the source comment is not the observable price ceiling.','The real sale consumer floors purchase/4 before multiplying quantity.')
u(7,87,102,'Card back/tile image request',[29,52,153],'card/tile type → static bitmap composition → native Bitmap','Creates an80×96 target; ordinary back requests opponent card artwork, while noback skips that background.','A provided type requests localized type sheet and Type.icon_position, crops64×28 at row×28 and blits at8,50 with opacity192.','Input type data and bitmap availability remain prerequisites; native pixels are unexecuted.','Disposes loaded temporary images after composition; returned target belongs to the caller.',disposition='PRESENTATION_REQUEST_RECORDED_UI_MEDIA_INTERFACE')
u(8,104,133,'Face image request',[21,29,153],'card identity/type/numbers/owner → composed face → board/hand/shop','Owner0 returns a back; owner2 chooses opponent art and every other nonzero owner chooses player art.','Target80×96 requests selected type sheet, supplied species/form icon and number strip.','Type crop64×28 appears8,50 at opacity192; creature icon crop64×64 appears8,24.','Number cells16×16 request west at8,16; north22,6; east36,16; south22,26; source x is direction value×16, including value10.','Temporary source bitmaps are disposed before returning the target; this is a rendering request and no claim of successful native display.',disposition='PRESENTATION_REQUEST_RECORDED_UI_MEDIA_INTERFACE')
