u(31,647,656,'Flip neighbors and guards',[88,92],'actual board attacker vs hypothetical AI square → neighbor tests','Neighbor order is left,right,up,down; each out-of-edge component either crosses board with wrap or clamps to its own edge coordinate.','Actual mode reads placed board square; hypothetical mode supplies a separate square.','Hypothetical evaluation rejects occupied target immediately; all modes reject missing-card or neutral-owner attacker.','Only actual placed ownership, not a dry candidate, supports recursive application to an occupied square.')
u(32,657,675,'Flip comparison',[29,52,88],'enemy populated neighbor → facing sides + optional attack increment','Empty neighboring card is skipped and friendly-owned card never compares.','Reads matching attack/facing defense direction.','When elements is active, only original nonrecursive attacker whose tile type equals its card type receives attack+1; defense unchanged, no mismatch penalty and values may exceed10.','Ordinary type effectiveness helper is commented out; no active bonus call applies when elements is off.')
u(33,676,696,'Flip commit, recursion and AI dry path',[49,88,90,92],'side comparison → ownership write → later adjacent recursion','Normally flip requires attack>defense; samewins additionally accepts equality.','Successful actual flip appends coordinate and writes enemy ownership immediately before recursive samewins traversal.','Every successful samewins flip may recurse, even strict superiority; no two-equal-side prerequisite or Plus rule.','Recursive changes affect subsequent directions, with recurse=true preventing element increments.','Hypothetical mode never changes defender ownership; recursive hypothetical target is occupied and fails guard, so its score is direct-flips only.')
u(34,700,716,'Validation and rule tokens',[47,57],'duel arguments → validated screen settings','Checks minimum and maximum individually0..9 then max≥min before storage or scene.','Only a nonempty Array is iterated; tokens are exact lowercase strings. Unknown tokens and nonarray do not enable a flag in a fresh screen.','samewins/openhand/wrap/elements/randomhand/countunplayed set flags true.','direct/winall/noprize set trade1/2/3; the last encountered trade token wins.','Maximum level is not consulted after validation.')
u(35,717,724,'Preparation copy and original count',[37,41,63],'permanent slots → ordered empty copy → admission/random domain','Begins with an empty temporary slot array, visits every permanent slot in order and adds its full quantity via helper.','Partial same-ID slots merge when room; full999 slots remain separate; this is not an array clone.','Admission count sums original slot quantities separately.','For legal warehouse states, preparation preserves total quantities while changing slot grouping; permanent warehouse remains unchanged.')
u(36,725,741,'Board and type generation',[59,73,153],'runtime Type.keys → independent square types','Assigns current player name or Trainer fallback when player is absent, plus caller opponent name; creates nine neutral empty squares.','elements samples all current type keys per trial, rejects pseudo types and retries same square.','With legal nonempty registry containing nonpseudo entries, accepted types are uniform over nonpseudo keys under ordinary sample semantics.','All-pseudo directory has no guaranteed termination; empty registry returns no usable type and lookup fails.','This occurs before scene/card-count guard and before hand/opponent/start-player draws.')
u(37,742,748,'Insufficient inventory guard',[41,77],'scene started → original count vs max hand → normal return0','Starts scene before testing count<5.','Insufficient count gives paused notice, normal end scene and result0; it is not a midgame surrender and does not debit inventory.')
u(38,749,760,'Player hand modes',[61,63],'prepared slots → five chosen identities','Randomhand samples a remaining slot uniformly on each draw, removes one and appends its identity.','It is not weighted by card quantity; exhausted slot removal changes subsequent domains.','Manual path receives the same prepared copy and returns a confirmed hand.','Permanent inventory remains unchanged in both paths.')
u(39,761,773,'Preset opponent validation',[65],'opponent input shape → preset normalized cards or random path','Only an Array of exactly maxCards5 entries uses preset path.','Each entry is loose looked up and normalized to registered ID.','Unknown legal identity displays error, closes scene and returns0; earlier temporary selection has not changed permanent cards.','Other input shapes, including4/6 entries, choose random generation instead of rejection.')
u(40,774,797,'Random opponent pool and level',[65,67],'Species.keys + owned query →200 weighted records → sorted window draws','Repeatedly samples from all registry keys, including shape-specific keys; resolves canonical record ID and computes four-side total.','Appends one candidate and an additional same candidate when player owns its base species and capacity remains.','Stops at exactly200; the last record may be unpaired. Duplicate identities are retained.','Sorts ascending by total, then draws five with replacement at minLevel+rand20.','This uses only indexes min..min+19, not a20-wide level-scaled bucket or maximum level.','Owned duplication and random candidate/sort ties prevent simple uniform or exactly-double final species probability.')
u(41,798,805,'Original snapshots and starter',[59,73,94],'hand identities → scene snapshots → random turn','Clones original player/opponent hands for settlement and separately for scene notification.','Displays opponent hand, timed starter notice and score before drawing rand2.','Chooses player first exactly when that draw is0; displays the chosen starter with timed notice.')
u(42,806,816,'Player turn and placement cancellation',[73,79,82],'selected current identity → position loop → final move','Nine-iteration turn loop begins with no position.','Player repeatedly selects a card and requests position until a coordinate is returned; nil from BACK returns to selection.','No hand card is removed or board cell written during cancellation.')
u(43,817,835,'AI candidate scores and selection set',[92],'every opponent card × every square → score ranking','Builds a hypothetical owner2 square for each current opponent hand card and gives it each evaluated tile type.','Only empty squares survive flip guard; score equals returned direct-flip count.','Sorts descending score; ties use a random−1/0/1 comparator, with call count controlled by sort.','Truncates sorted candidates to current opponent hand length; later sampling is uniform over this truncated array, not all tied positions.','No optimal strategy or stable/uniform tie ordering is implied.')
u(44,836,846,'AI selection and impossible ordinary empty branch',[83,92],'scores → selected card/position or unsupported continue','If no score candidate exists, displays a timed notice and toggles turn before evaluating an undefined continue identifier.','Fixed script lookup found no continue definition; it is not a reliable skip mechanism.','Ordinary legal nine-turn flow with available opponent card and at least one empty square does not reach that branch.','Otherwise draws one retained candidate, reconstructs its card and requests reveal/movement.')
u(45,847,859,'Placement commit order',[73,84,90],'valid coordinate → card/owner → flips → hand deletion → scene','Writes board card then current owner before actual flip.','Actual flips finish before removing selected identity from current hand.','Scene completion receives original selection index, then turn toggles.','After nine legal alternating moves one card remains in the second mover hand.')
u(46,860,870,'Final count',[94],'all nine board owners + optionally remaining hands → result branch','Counts player1 and opponent2 board ownership.','countunplayed adds remaining hand lengths; normal total9 excludes ties, total10 permits5:5.')
u(47,871,886,'Draw and direct transfer',[115,119,120,121],'paused draw result → optional direct warehouse rewrite','Announces draw before setting result3 or moving cards.','Only direct draw deletes original player five by correct each-card identity, adds unplayed player cards, then row-major own-color cards resolved through species/form.','Every transfer return is ignored; there is no rollback across entries.','Direct draw then reports kept own-color cards; other draw modes leave warehouse unchanged.')
u(48,887,902,'Win prize override and ordinary reward',[119,123],'paused win → result1 → prize or ordinary branch','Win message returns before result1 and any reward.','Any truthy prize suppresses all normal trade branches including noprize; loose lookup unknown gives no reward and no fallback.','Legal prize addition and ordinary random-one addition display received-card text only when add returns true.','Default random reward samples original opponent five by position, retaining duplicate-position weight.')
u(49,903,917,'Win direct/winall/noprize',[119,123],'result1 without truthy prize → mode transfer','Win direct deletes original player five, then adds unplayed and own-color board identities.','Winall adds opponent original five one at a time; both modes ignore individual returns and still report batch success.','noprize has no matching transfer branch and makes no ordinary card mutation.','No opponent permanent warehouse is referenced.')
u(50,918,940,'Loss transfer and residual-identity anomaly',[120,123,125],'paused loss → result2 → ordinary/direct/winall/noprize','Default loss samples one original player position, removes that identity and reports it without checking remove.','Direct loss loops five times but removes residual card identity rather than loop card: last sampled candidate species with random opponent, nil with valid preset opponent.','Thus random mode can consume unrelated reserves of that residual species; preset mode normally removes nothing and later additions can duplicate held cards.','Then adds unplayed player cards and row-major own-color board cards, ignoring returns and reporting kept-color result.','winall removes original player five by correct identities; noprize performs no ordinary loss transfer.','Prize parameter does not affect draw or loss; partial warehouse changes are retained if a later operation fails.')
u(51,941,945,'Normal result return',[15,84,115],'settlement → normal end scene → result','Normal settlement ends scene, then returns1/2/3.','No local rescue/ensure rolls back stored cards or guarantees scene/audio restoration when any intervening dependency raises.')
u(52,950,953,'Duel readiness query',[39,41],'lazy permanent triads → total count≥5','Returns whether warehouse total is at least metadata minimum5.','No money, coins, coin-case or current party species qualification is checked.')
u(53,955,963,'Public duel wrapper',[15,77,153],'public arguments → music/fade wrapper → fresh scene/screen → return','Initial return is0; wrapper allocates a new scene and screen and passes all six inputs.','Returns the inner duel result on normal completion; wrapper is not an independent midgame quit path.','Music/fade wrapper has outer fade cleanup but does not guarantee music resume or card rollback when inner code raises.')
u(54,968,977,'Persistent metadata extension',[37,41],'global metadata lazy triads → current/game save object','Supports replacing the stored triads field; getter creates a new empty TriadStorage when field is falsey.','Minimum readiness constant is5.','Storage is nested in global metadata whole-object save/load; board and hand arrays are screen-local, not part of this persistence field.')
u(55,982,1009,'Storage basic views and clear',[37],'warehouse array → querying/preparation/UI/save','Initial item list is empty; readable items and indexed slot return the actual underlying values.','length and empty reflect occupied slot-array length.','maxSize evaluates current length+1 at each call; it is neither999 total slots nor999 total cards.','clear empties that same item array; there is no species validation or automatic saved-file write.')
u(56,1011,1020,'Checked storage slot getters',[37,133],'UI row index → card identity or slot count','get_item returns nil when index<0 or index≥length; otherwise slot identity.','get_item_count returns0 for those same invalid indexes; otherwise that individual slot quantity.','Unchecked bracket access follows underlying array behavior; it must not be confused with the checked row helper. These primitive views are supporting interface facts, not a proposed concrete future API.')
u(57,1022,1043,'Storage quantity, mutation and total',[37,39,41],'direct warehouse operation → ItemStorageHelper → persisted state','Quantity sums all equal stored identities, not only selected slot.','can_add/add pass current length+1 and999 to pure-precheck/ordered-write helpers.','remove may consume all available matching slots and return false when insufficient; neither direction rolls back a failed partial mutation.','Negative quantity raises; zero quantity succeeds with no mutation. Direct operations do not normalize/check species identity.','total_cards adds every stored slot quantity; ordinary admission uses this total.')
u(58,1048,1081,'Shop list and normal opening',[131,133],'base species owned query → sorted purchase commands → scroll/preview','Enumerates only form0 species; owned gate uses base species boolean query, not current party or has_pokedex flag.','Computes card price, sorts by displayed localized species name and prepares display rows.','Empty candidate list only displays notice and returns.','Normal opening requests map-left scroll3 at speed5, command/gold windows and first card preview.','Input/rendering exceptions have no local transaction/restore guarantee.')
u(59,1082,1130,'Purchase loop',[131],'highlight → affordability/number/confirmation → capacity/add → money','Updates command/gold and preview before BACK>USE arbitration.','First money check requires one card; max affordable is min99,floor(balance/unitprice), initial1 and cancel0.','Nonpositive quantity or refused confirmation skips purchase; total-price affordability is checked again after confirmation.','Capacity precheck failure leaves money/cards unchanged.','Successful precheck is followed by add whose return is ignored, then money subtraction through validated clamp setter and displayed updated money.','Thanks message and sound request occur after inventory/money writes; failure in that message does not undo them.')
u(60,1131,1138,'Purchase normal cleanup',[133,153],'normal shop exit → dispose → reverse map scroll','Normal BACK exit disposes widgets/preview, resets frame state, then requests map-right scroll3 speed5.','This reverse request follows current map state; no exception ensure guarantees restoration of initial view.')
u(61,1140,1173,'Sale list and opening',[133],'every warehouse slot → names/counts/cancel → preview','Builds one list entry per warehouse slot and appends CANCEL; sums total cards.','Zero total shows no-cards notice and returns before scrolling/opening.','Normal opening requests the same left3/speed5 scroll, money window and initial checked-slot preview.')
u(62,1174,1236,'Sale loop and transaction',[31,133],'selected slot → aggregate same-ID quantity → money before remove','Updates command/gold/preview, and BACK exits before the separate USE branch; CANCEL row USE exits.','Selected quantity is total across matching identity slots, not selected row count.','For quantity>1 opens1..total initial1 cancel0; quantity1 skips number selection.','Zero/nonpositive selection or rejected confirmation leaves sale writes unperformed.','Computes floor(unit purchase price/4)×quantity; confirmation adds money via clamp and updates money display before warehouse removal.','Remove return is ignored; already-at-money-cap still loses cards and announced quote need not equal actual delta.','Successful normal sale rebuilds per-slot commands and CANCEL; no minimum-five reserve guard exists.','Unreachable zero-price branch tries an unqualified paused-display function; valid generated card price is at least10, so ordinary finite pricing never reaches it.')
u(63,1237,1244,'Sale normal cleanup',[133,153],'normal sale exit → dispose → reverse scroll','Disposes widgets/preview, resets frames and requests map-right3/speed5.','An exception after wallet/card write retains that prefix; cleanup/reverse-scroll are only normal-tail behavior.')
u(64,1246,1289,'Read-only card list',[133],'permanent slots → per-row names/counts/preview','Lists every occupied slot, appends CANCEL and returns after a notice if total is0.','Highlight changes dispose prior target and request a face only for a real row.','BACK or USE on CANCEL exits; USE on a card does not select, trade or mutate it.','Normal tail disposes command and sprite; list performs no card-warehouse or money write.')
u(65,1294,1300,'Gift wrapper',[39],'loose species lookup → capacity check → add → boolean','Unknown legal identity returns false before accessing/addition.','Valid identity is normalized to record ID and prechecked at requested quantity.','Precheck false returns false with no card changes; true calls add and returns true without checking execution return.','Negative quantity for valid identity follows helper error; zero succeeds without adding.','No party, wallet, seen/owned or global reward-stat write accompanies the card gift.')
